lated independently from published game results. They are not official ratings. This site is not affiliated with the Nihon Ki-in, the Kansai Ki-in, or any tournament sponsor.</p><p class="footer-sister">Sister site: <a href="https://shogirate.com/en">Shogi Player Ratings (shogirate.com)</a></p><p class="footer-updated">Last updated: October 7, 2026</p><p class="footer-operator">Operated by igorating.com</p></footer></body></html>